     [38;5;246mOne core file loadable as both CommonJS and a browser global, plus a localStorage sink and a file sink. Redaction [39m
     [38;5;246mand record shape live in exactly one place.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Two independent loggers
     [38;5;246mSeparate per-runtime loggers sharing only a written schema. Least plumbing, but the allow-list is duplicated and [39m
     [38;5;246mwill drift.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: Convert to ES modules
     [38;5;246mCleanest sharing, but rewrites the CommonJS files and breaks opening index.html over file:// (needs a local [39m
